- `class PPTOutlineWaiters`ï¼š`dict[str, asyncio.Future]`ï¼Œ`add(oid, fut)/resolve(oid, decision)/pop(oid)`ï¼ˆç…§æ?`SkillCandidateWaiters` @skill_codifier:285-317ï¼‰ã€?*`pop` å®žçŽ°ä¸ºå¹‚ç­?`self._d.pop(oid, None)`ã€`resolve` å¯¹å·² pop/å·?done çš?fut no-op**ï¼ˆé˜² double-pop KeyError + åŒé¢æ¿é‡å¤?resolveï¼ŒR5ï¼‰ã€?- **åŽ†å²æŒä¹…åŒ?*ï¼ˆç”¨æˆ·è¦ã€Œå­˜åŽ†å²å¤§çº²ã€ï¼‰ï¼š`ppt_outline_history` è¡¨ï¼ˆSessionDBï¼Œä»¿ `ensure_session_goals_table` çš?flag-gated å»ºè¡¨ï¼Œ`pro_outline_history` å¼€æ‰å»ºï¼Œä¿ BC å­—èŠ‚åŸºçº¿ï¼‰ã€‚å­—æ®µï¼š`outline_id TEXT PK, session_id, topic, created_at, slides_json TEXT, sources_count INT, status TEXT(proposed/accepted/rejected/superseded)`ã€?  - `save_outline(oid, sid, topic, slides, sources)` / `mark_status(oid, status)` / `list_history(sid, limit=20)` / `get_outline(oid)`ï¼ˆä¾›ã€Œä»ŽåŽ†å²å¤ç”¨ã€ï¼‰ã€?
